# One rule, stated once: every text file is LF in the blob and LF on checkout.
#
# Ruled 2026-09-05 (halheinrich/Math#50); `../VISION.md` § Conventions carries
# the reasoning. `.editorconfig` states the same rule to the editor at `[*]`,
# because two mechanisms need the answer — git at checkout, the editor while
# writing — and they must say the same thing.
#
# No per-extension exceptions, deliberately. This member carried five of them
# (.sln .csproj .props .targets .cs) and that list is exactly what diverged: it
# still named .sln, a format this member has not had since the .slnx ruling of
# the same day, and never named .slnx. A list maintained in two files cannot be
# kept in sync, only re-diverged.
* text=auto eol=lf
